// The output A1 A0 names goes on: Y0 (north), Y1 (east), Y2 (top), Y3 (bottom).
name Decoder 2:4
port a A0 in
port b A1 in
port w Y0 out
port x Y1 out
port y Y2 out
port z Y3 out
alu U diamond
chip U 0 NOT
chip U 1 NOT
chip U 2 AND
chip U 3 AND
chip U 4 AND
chip U 5 AND
wire U in:W 0:A
wire U in:S 1:A
wire U 0:Q 2:A
wire U 1:Q 2:B
wire U in:W 3:A
wire U 1:Q 3:B
wire U 0:Q 4:A
wire U in:S 4:B
wire U in:W 5:A
wire U in:S 5:B
wire U 2:Q out:N
wire U 3:Q out:E
wire U 4:Q out:U
wire U 5:Q out:D
layer
....
....
..z.
....
....
layer
..w.
....
a-Ux
..-.
..b.
layer
....
....
..y.
